# 📊 AI Content Performance Analyzer

A **Generative AI module** that evaluates social media posts and predicts their **engagement performance**.

The system analyzes content using **engagement signals, audience psychology, and platform algorithms** to estimate how well a post might perform.

It provides **improvement suggestions to increase reach, engagement, and content effectiveness**.

---

# 🎯 System Objective

The **Content Performance Analyzer** helps creators understand **how effective their content is before publishing**.

The AI evaluates:

✔ Hook strength  
✔ Content clarity  
✔ Value delivery  
✔ Engagement potential  
✔ Call-to-action effectiveness  

This allows creators to **optimize posts before posting them online**.

